{0 session}

{v
# Session Module Reference

High-level session API (functions from ocaml/src/session.ml).

Create/close
- `with_session ~sw ~net cfg (fun session -> ...) : (('a, Error.t) result)` — opens, authenticates, and closes a connection (sends GOODBYE).
- `close : t -> unit` (implicitly used by `with_session`).

Query (strict)
- `run ~statement ?parameters ?fetch_size () : (Value.value list list, Error.t) result`
- `run_records ~statement ?parameters ?fetch_size () : (Record.t list, Error.t) result`

Streaming
- `run_stream ~statement ?parameters ?fetch_size () : (stream, Error.t) result`
  - `stream.fetch_next : unit -> (Value.value list, Error.t) result`
  - `stream.exhausted : bool`
- `run_stream_records ... : (record_stream, Error.t) result`
  - `record_stream.fetch_next_records : unit -> (Record.t list, Error.t) result`
  - `record_stream.exhausted : bool`
- Collectors: `stream_to_list`, `record_stream_to_list`

Transactions
- `begin_transaction : (unit, Error.t) result`
- `commit : (unit, Error.t) result`, `rollback : (unit, Error.t) result`
- `transact : (t -> ('a, Error.t) result) -> ('a, Error.t) result`

Recovery
- `reset : (unit, Error.t) result` — clear failed state (auto‑issued on server FAILURE outside transactions)
v}
